# Build context hygiene: node_modules alone is gigabytes and is reinstalled from
# the lockfile inside the image anyway.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.expo
**/.turbo
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
.git
.tasks
docs
*.md
!apps/web/index.html

# Secrets: the prod build context is the server's /opt/budget checkout.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.prod.example
